Summary:
During today’s session, we focused on making general improvements to the existing functionalities of the Developer Portfolio Evaluator application. The previously implemented features were revisited and refined to ensure smoother operation and better reliability. Minor adjustments were made in both frontend and backend to enhance the overall workflow and user interaction. The application was tested across different scenarios to confirm that all features were working as expected. These changes were aimed at improving consistency and maintaining stability in the system.

Outcomes:
By the end of the session, the application exhibited more consistent and reliable behavior across its functionalities. The refinements helped in reducing minor issues and improved the overall user experience. The system responded more effectively to user inputs and handled operations more smoothly. Existing features were better aligned and functioned without errors during testing. Overall, the project became more polished and stable without introducing any major new changes.
